OL,3,GNEWSAPoole A&E closure: 'We need it now
OL,4,Amore than ever'                        
OL,6,FA hospital's emergency department that 
OL,7,Fis due to close in April is needed     
OL,8,F"more than ever", a councillor has     
OL,9,Fsaid.                                  
OL,11,FBournemouth Christchurch and Poole     
OL,12,F(BCP) councillor Pete Miles wants to   
OL,13,Freopen the debate about Poole's A&E,   
OL,14,Fdescribing it as "absolute chaos"      
OL,15,Fduring a recent visit.                 
OL,17,FThe emergency department is due to move
OL,18,Fto Royal Bournemouth Hospital (RBH),   
OL,19,Fwith Poole Hospital becoming a centre  
OL,20,Ffor planned care.                      
