OL,4,Amore than ever'                        
OL,6,FUniversity Hospitals Dorset (UHD) said 
OL,7,Fthe majority of patients attending     
OL,8,FPoole Hospital would continue to be    
OL,9,Ftreated at its 24-hour Urgent Treatment
OL,10,FCentre.                                
